(She called it "song"... but it's a word I've never heard before.)

226
00:28:00,294 --> 00:28:07,294
（だけど「ウタ」は、あたしの心の深いところに確かに染み込んできた……）
(Yet that "song" definitely seeped deep into my heart...)

