305
00:35:12,732 --> 00:35:16,132
ちょ、ちょっと私には可愛すぎない？
Wait, isn't this a bit too cute for me?

306
00:35:16,332 --> 00:35:20,232
そんなことないよー！すっごくぴったり！
Not at all! It fits you perfectly!

307
00:35:20,632 --> 00:35:23,032
そ、そうかな……？
R-Really...?

308
00:35:23,432 --> 00:35:26,932
きみはこの『ステージ衣装』を着て……
Put on this "stage outfit" and...

309
00:35:27,232 --> 00:35:29,832
Let's sing with me!!

310
00:35:51,232 --> 00:35:57,732
YEAH~

311
00:36:05,032 --> 00:36:11,832
The knacks of surviving in this world are being human and being right

312
