313
00:36:18,932 --> 00:36:22,932
Your unfair rules Ego trip into a loop

314
00:36:23,032 --> 00:36:27,432
We do belong nowhere in this world

315
00:36:27,532 --> 00:36:31,832
Yet we are surviving Getting through anything Stay alive

316
00:36:32,732 --> 00:36:36,132
Hated ones Naked hearts

317
00:36:36,232 --> 00:36:39,532
Worthless games that never end

318
00:36:39,632 --> 00:36:44,132
